.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-plan 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-plan \- Whether the branch\*(Aqs plan has the shape a checked plan has
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten plan\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether the branch\*(Aqs plan has the shape a checked plan has
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-plan\-lint(1)
Refuse a branch plan that fails a checkable clause, or write its receipt
.TP
batten\-plan\-path(1)
Print where this branch\*(Aqs plan file is, creating nothing
.TP
batten\-plan\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
